# Spec contract

Every Feature is `spec/<slug>/` with `spec.md`, `tasks.md`, and `review.md`. Scaffold from `spec/_templates/feature/` via `new-feature`.

If any Task is `type: code`, `tests/*.feature` must exist before those Tasks are executed.

“Tests pass”: `process/glossary.md`.
